{"articleNo":"82096","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=82096&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014 호주 정부초청 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.04.24","hit":"4037","attachments":[{"name":"2014 호주연방정부 장학금.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=82096&attachNo=71509"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">호주 연방 정부에서는 아시아, 태평양 지역 학생을 위한 2014년 호주 정부초청 장학생을 아래와 같이 초청코자 합니다. 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;호주 정부 장학생 프로그램 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;장학금 규모</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 18.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">-학비 및 생활비 지원 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-국가별 쿼터는 없으며 우수 인재 우선 선발 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-상세한 정보는 아래 웹사이트 참조</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;장학금 종류 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 11.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- Endeavour Postgraduate Scholarships </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(includes Prime Minister’s Australia Asia Incoming Scholarship)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 11.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- Endeavour Vocational Education and Training (VET) Scholarship</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 11.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- Endeavour Executive Fellowship</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 11.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: