IGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-서류 준비 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-온라인 신청만 가능 (2013년 6월 30일까지)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-신청 전에 자주하는 질문 (FAQ)을 반드시 숙지하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 발표: 2013년 12월말 개별 통보 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 관련 웹사이트 및 연락처</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">주한호주대사관 교육부</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=